# Xilinx Vitis / SDK build artifacts
# ============================================

# Vitis IDE workspace files
RAPID/_ide/
RAPID/motorDriver_SW/_ide/
RAPID/motorDriver/_ide/

# Vitis platform build output
RAPID/motorDriver/export/
RAPID/motorDriver/hw/
RAPID/motorDriver/logs/
RAPID/motorDriver/ps7_cortexa9_0/
RAPID/motorDriver/resources/
RAPID/motorDriver/zynq_fsbl/
